## Article 280. Challenging restrictions on peaceful assembly

```catala
declaration scope Article280AssemblyRestriction:
  input check content AssemblyCaseCheck
  output restrictionChallengeable content YesNo
  output restrictionUnlawful content YesNo
  output restrictionProportionate content YesNo

scope Article280AssemblyRestriction:
# Assembly restriction decisions can be challenged
  label challengeable definition restrictionChallengeable under condition
    check.authorityIssuedDecision = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_challengeable definition restrictionChallengeable under condition
    check.authorityIssuedDecision = No
    consequence equals No

# Restriction unlawful when disproportionate
  label unlawful definition restrictionUnlawful under condition
    check.restrictionProportionate = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label lawful definition restrictionUnlawful under condition
    check.restrictionProportionate = Yes
    and check.restrictionBasedOnPublicSafety = Yes
    consequence equals No

# Proportionality assessment
  label proportionate definition restrictionProportionate under condition
    check.restrictionProportionate = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label disproportionate definition restrictionProportionate under condition
    check.restrictionProportionate = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 281. Deadlines for assembly cases

```catala
declaration scope Article281AssemblyDeadlines:
  input check content AssemblyCaseCheck
  output considerationWithinThreeDays content YesNo
  output appealWithinThreeDays content YesNo

scope Article281AssemblyDeadlines:
# Case must be considered within 3 days
  label three_day_consideration definition considerationWithinThreeDays equals Yes

# Appeal must be filed within 3 days of decision
  label three_day_appeal definition appealWithinThreeDays under condition
    check.restrictionAppealedWithinThreeDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label appeal_expired definition appealWithinThreeDays under condition
    check.restrictionAppealedWithinThreeDays = No
    consequence equals No
```
